The pattern followed here is,

1) HKNQT → H + 3 = K; K + 3 = N; N + 3 = Q; Q + 3 = T;

2) **TWYBC → T + 3 = W; W + 2 = Y; Y + 3 = B; B + 1 = C**;

3) BEHKN → B + 3 = E; E + 3 = H; H + 3 = K; K + 3 = N;

4) QTWZC → Q + 3 = T; T + 3 = W; W + 3 = Z; Z + 3 = C;

Hence, TWYBC is the odd one out.
